<p><strong>Pre-Move Video Surveys</strong>
Before booking any <strong>bike transport by train booking</strong> service or air cargo, conduct a detailed video survey. Record all angles of your bike, highlighting existing scratches, dents, or mechanical issues. This documentation serves as legal proof of condition, protecting you from false damage claims.</p>
<p>Use this video during the handover process to establish a baseline. Many professional <strong>bike transport service by train</strong> providers require this footage to finalize their insurance coverage. Without it, resolving disputes becomes significantly more difficult and time-consuming.</p>
<p><strong>Decluttering Strategies</strong>
Remove all personal items from the bike frame. Detach helmets, floor mats, and accessories. These items should be packed separately in standard cartons.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Do not leave valuables in the seat tube or under the saddle.</p>
